'''ENVY''' (formerly known as '''Team EnVyUs''' or '''Team Envy''', often abbreviated to '''Envy''', '''EnVy''' or '''nV''') is an [[:category:United States|American]] esports organization based in [[wikipedia:Dallas|Dallas]].

The brand was retired after being acquired by [[OpTic Gaming]] in 2022; <ref name="optic acquires envy">{{cite web|url=https://www.dallasnews.com/sports/optic-texas/2022/06/27/envy-gaming-retires-its-esports-brand-becomes-optic-gaming/|title=Envy Gaming retires its esports brand, becomes OpTic Gaming|date=2022-06-27|author=The Dallas Morning News}}</ref> the organization was later re-established on January 17th, 2025 after Mike "[[Hastr0]]" Rufail re-acquired the brand. <ref name="hastr0 reacquires envy">{{cite web|url=https://dotesports.com/call-of-duty/news/team-envy-revived-by-hastr0-with-dallas-fuel-dallas-empire-in-tow|title=Team Envy revived by Hastr0 with Dallas Fuel, Dallas Empire in tow|date=2025-01-17|author=Dot Esports}}</ref> 

