==Controversy==
In December 2025, ENVY was criticized for fielding [[sinatraa]] as a stand-in for [[For_Those_Who_Dare/2025|For Those Who Dare 2025]], which marked the player's return to competition after last playing in 2021 with [[Sentinels]]. The player is [[Banned_players|banned]] from [[Riot Games|Riot]] events and entered an extended period of inactivity after allegedly failing to cooperate with an investigation into allegations of sexual abuse and assault. <ref name="Sinatra  Ruling">{{cite web|url=https://playvalorant.com/en-us/news/esports/competitive-ruling-jay-sinatraa-won/|title=Competitive Ruling: Jay “Sinatraa” Won|date=2021-05-17|publisher=[[Riot Games]]}}</ref>

